      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-1">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#18181b] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#27272a] space-y-1.5">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">Principle 1</div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#171717] dark:text-white">Control the Center</h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed">
            Controlling the four central squares (e4, d4, e5, d5) grants your pieces maximum scope and flexibility. Stake an early claim by pushing a central pawn.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#18181b] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#27272a] space-y-1.5">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">Principle 2</div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#171717] dark:text-white">Develop Minor Pieces First</h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed">
